---
import MainGridLayout from "@/layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";

interface Props {
	lang?: string;
}

const { lang = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/en") ? "en" : "zh_CN" } =
	Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === "en";

const title = isEn
	? "Grounded Wings · The Earliest Flightless Bird"
	: "弃飞者 · GROUNDED WINGS";
const description = isEn
	? "Grounded Wings: Exploring Yuezhuornis yangyuanensis, the 150-million-year-old Late Jurassic fossil bird from Fujian, China, that gave up flight for sprinting across swamps (Nature 2026)."
	: "弃飞者 · GROUNDED WINGS：探索中国福建发现的晚侏罗世古鸟「杨源鸑鷟鸟」。《自然》2026年10月14日发表成果，揭示已知最早丧失持续飞行能力的古鸟类，前肢短于后肢，奔跑在1.5亿年前的侏罗纪沼泽。";
---

<MainGridLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang}>
	<div class="flex w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden relative min-h-32 mb-8">
		<div class="z-10 px-4 sm:px-8 py-8 relative w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden bg-[#070b14] text-slate-100 border border-slate-800/80 shadow-2xl selection:bg-emerald-500/30 selection:text-emerald-200">
			<!-- Ambient Jurassic Swamp & Fossil Ambient Glow -->
			<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(#10b981_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:28px_28px] overflow-hidden"></div>
			<div class="absolute -top-32 -left-32 w-80 h-80 bg-emerald-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute top-1/4 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-10 left-1/3 w-96 h-96 bg-teal-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

			<!-- HERO HEADER SECTION -->
			<header class="relative z-10 mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wide">
							<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
							<span>NATURE · 2026-10-14 · WANG ET AL.</span>
						</div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-300 text-xs font-mono">
							<span>🪶</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">晚侏罗世 · 早期鸟类弃飞演化</span>
							<span class="lang-en">LATE JURASSIC · EARLY AVIAN FLIGHT LOSS</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- In-Page Language & Origin Switcher -->
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 hidden sm:block">
							<span class="lang-zh">福建杨源化石发现 · 距今约 1.5 亿年</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Fujian Yangyuan Discovery · ~150 Ma</span>
						</div>
						<a
							id="inpage-lang-toggle"
							href={isEn ? "/projects/grounded-wings/" : "/en/projects/grounded-wings/"}
							class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-emerald-500/40 text-emerald-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-emerald-950/60 font-mono text-xs transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95"
							title={isEn ? "Switch to Chinese" : "切换为英文"}
						>
							<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
								<path d="m12.87 15.07-2.54-2.51.03-.03A17.52 17.52 0 0 0 14.07 6H17V4h-7V2H8v2H1v2h11.17C11.5 7.92 10.44 9.75 9 11.35 8.07 10.32 7.3 9.19 6.69 8h-2c.73 1.63 1.73 3.17 2.98 4.56l-5.09 5.02L4 19l5-5 3.11 3.11.76-2.04zM18.5 10h-2L12 22h2l1.12-3h4.75L21 22h2l-4.5-12zm-2.62 7 1.62-4.33L19.12 17h-3.24z"/>
							</svg>
							<span class="lang-zh font-bold">English</span>
							<span class="lang-en font-bold">中文</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white mb-2 font-sans">
					<span class="lang-zh">弃飞者 · GROUNDED WINGS</span>
					<span class="lang-en">GROUNDED WINGS</span>
				</h1>

				<p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-emerald-400 mb-4 tracking-wide font-mono">
					<span class="lang-zh">谁说鸟类诞生就必须冲向天空？1.5亿年前，第一只小鸟主动收起翅膀，迈开长腿踏入泥沼。</span>
					<span class="lang-en">Who said birds only evolved to conquer skies? 150 million years ago, an early bird packed its wings and sprinted across Jurassic mud.</span>
				</p>

				<div class="space-y-3 max-w-3xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
					<p>
						<span class="lang-zh">
							2026 年 10 月 14 日，国际顶级期刊《自然》（Nature）发表了一项改写鸟类演化教科书的里程碑发现：中国科学院古脊椎动物与古人类研究所（IVPP）王敏研究团队联合福建省地质科学研究所，在福建省政和县杨源乡晚侏罗世地层（距今约 1.48–1.5 亿年）中发掘出一件奇特古鸟类化石——<strong>杨源鸑鷟鸟（<em>Yuezhuornis yangyuanensis</em>）</strong>。其属名取自中国古代五凤神鸟之一的“鸑鷟”。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							On October 14, 2026, Nature published a landmark paleontological study led by Min Wang at the Institute of Vertebrate Paleontology and Paleoanthropology (IVPP), Chinese Academy of Sciences, alongside the Fujian Institute of Geological Sciences. The team uncovered a remarkable ~148–150 million-year-old Late Jurassic fossil bird in Yangyuan village, Zhenghe County, Fujian Province, China: <strong><em>Yuezhuornis yangyuanensis</em></strong>, named after the legendary Chinese mythical bird Yuezhuo.
						</span>
					</p>
					<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">
						<span class="lang-zh">
							这只体型与乌鸦相仿（高约 0.5 米、体重略超 800 克）的古鸟带来了一个惊天反转：与同处于晚侏罗世、前肢显著长于后肢的德国始祖鸟不同，杨源鸑鷟鸟的<strong>前肢明确短于后肢</strong>，解剖比例高度趋同于现代地栖奔跑的雉类与走鹃。它不仅是目前<strong>已知最早丧失持续飞行能力</strong>的早期鸟类，更展现出震撼的“解剖镶嵌”：鸟类特化的骨盆与长腿，搭配恐龙原始的密生锯齿牙和极度伸屈的第二脚趾。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							Crow-sized (about 0.5 m tall and just over 800 g), this ancient avialan delivered a profound hook: unlike its contemporary Late Jurassic Archaeopteryx whose forelimbs were longer than its hindlimbs, Yuezhuornis possessed <strong>forelimbs distinctly shorter than its hindlimbs</strong>—a ratio matching modern ground-dwelling pheasants and roadrunners. It represents the <strong>earliest known example of a bird losing the ability to fly</strong>, built as an anatomical mosaic of advanced avian pelvis/legs alongside dinosaurian serrated teeth and a hyper-extensible second toe.
						</span>
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Attributed Researcher Quote Card -->
				<div class="mt-6 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-emerald-500/30 relative overflow-hidden">
					<div class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
						<span>💬</span>
						<span class="lang-zh">领衔科学家论断 · MIN WANG (IVPP)</span>
						<span class="lang-en">LEAD RESEARCHER PERSPECTIVE · MIN WANG (IVPP)</span>
					</div>
					<blockquote class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-200 italic font-serif leading-relaxed">
						<span class="lang-zh">
							王敏研究员指出：“<strong class="text-emerald-300">Yuezhuornis challenges the traditional paradigm that the avian body plan evolved almost exclusively under the selective pressures of flight.</strong>”
							<span class="block text-xs font-sans text-slate-400 not-italic mt-1">（杨源鸑鷟鸟挑战了鸟类体型结构几乎完全在飞行选择压力下演化的传统范式。）</span>
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							Min Wang said, "<strong class="text-emerald-300">Yuezhuornis challenges the traditional paradigm that the avian body plan evolved almost exclusively under the selective pressures of flight.</strong>"
						</span>
					</blockquote>
				</div>

				<!-- Key Fossil Facts Row -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mt-6">
					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
							<span class="lang-zh">地质时代与地层</span>
							<span class="lang-en">GEOLOGICAL AGE</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-2xl font-mono font-black text-white mt-1">~150 Ma</div>
						<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">晚侏罗世 · 148–150 百万年前</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Late Jurassic · 148–150 Ma</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
							<span class="lang-zh">体型高度与质量</span>
							<span class="lang-en">BODY METRICS</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-2xl font-mono font-black text-amber-300 mt-1">~0.5 m / &gt;800 g</div>
						<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">乌鸦体型 · 实测化石骨骼推算</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Crow-sized · Fossil measurements</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-teal-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
							<span class="lang-zh">现生鸟类解剖基准</span>
							<span class="lang-en">COMPARATIVE DATASET</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-2xl font-mono font-black text-teal-300 mt-1">~400 种</div>
						<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">横跨现生各目近 400 种鸟类测量</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Nearly 400 living bird species</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
							<span class="lang-zh">前肢 / 后肢比例</span>
							<span class="lang-en">LIMB RATIO</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-2xl font-mono font-black text-cyan-300 mt-1">前肢 &lt; 后肢</div>
						<div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">短前肢长后肢 · 地栖奔跑型</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Short wings, long legs · Runner</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</header>

			<!-- 1. INTERACTIVE ELEMENT: WING SLIDER LAB -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-12 pb-10 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold mb-1">
							<span>LAB 01</span>
							<span>·</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">翼身比例动力学滑块</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Wing-to-Leg Ratio Simulator</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
							<span class="lang-zh">翼身比例测量台：多长的翅膀才能飞上天？</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Wing Slider: Forelimb/Hindlimb Ratio and Flight Capacity</span>
						</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="text-xs font-mono px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-300">
						<span class="lang-zh">⚠️ 示意模型，非实测数据</span>
						<span class="lang-en">⚠️ Illustrative model, not measured data</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed mb-6">
					<span class="lang-zh">
						在鸟类生物力学中，前肢（翅膀）与后肢（长腿）的相对比例是判断运动生活方式的核心指示器。拖动下方滑块或点击不同物种预设：观察绘制的鸟类轮廓翼长如何伸缩、飞行能力综合评分如何跳变。晚侏罗世的杨源鸑鷟鸟前肢比值仅约 0.70，与始祖鸟（~1.15）截然不同，完全落入了现代地栖快跑鸟类的范畴。
					</span>
					<span class="lang-en">
						In avian biomechanics, the forelimb-to-hindlimb length ratio is a prime indicator of locomotion strategy. Drag the slider or click presets to see the silhouette's wings expand/contract and watch the Flight Score meter calibrate. Yuezhuornis (~0.70 ratio) contrasts starkly with Archaeopteryx (~1.15), aligning closely with modern ground cursors.
					</span>
				</p>

				<!-- Wing Slider Lab Grid -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start">
					<!-- Interactive Silhouette Display Column (7 cols) -->
					<div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-[#050811] rounded-2xl p-4 border border-slate-800 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center">
						<div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mb-2 px-1">
							<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
								<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
								<span class="lang-zh">鸟类躯干剪影实时变形</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Live Silhouette Morphing</span>
							</div>
							<div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold" id="slider-ratio-display">
								Ratio: 0.70 (Yuezhuornis)
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Silhouette SVG Viewport -->
						<div class="relative w-full aspect-16/10 max-h-[360px] bg-slate-950/70 rounded-xl border border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
							<svg id="bird-silhouette-svg" viewBox="0 0 500 320" class="w-full h-full select-none">
								<!-- Swamp Horizon Line -->
								<line x1="20" y1="270" x2="480" y2="270" stroke="#334155" stroke-dasharray="4 4" stroke-width="1.5" />
								<text x="25" y="290" fill="#64748b" font-size="11" font-family="monospace">
									Swamp Ground Surface / 沼泽泥滩水平面
								</text>

								<!-- Hindlimbs (Constant Long Sturdy Legs) -->
								<g id="svg-legs" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none">
									<!-- Left Leg (Thigh, Shin, Tarsus, Extended Second Toe) -->
									<polyline points="230,170 215,220 235,265" />
									<line x1="235" y1="265" x2="255" y2="267" stroke-width="4" />
									<line x1="235" y1="265" x2="230" y2="254" stroke="#f43f5e" stroke-width="3" /> <!-- Extensible 2nd toe -->

									<!-- Right Leg (Back layer) -->
									<polyline points="245,170 260,218 250,265" opacity="0.7" />
									<line x1="250" y1="265" x2="270" y2="267" stroke-width="4" opacity="0.7" />
								</g>

								<!-- Bird Torso & Long Tail -->
								<g id="svg-body">
									<!-- Feathered Tail -->
									<path d="M 180 150 C 130 155 80 170 50 190 C 80 175 140 165 180 162 Z" fill="#10b981" opacity="0.8" />
									<!-- Torso Oval -->
									<ellipse cx="230" cy="155" rx="55" ry="32" fill="#0f766e" />
									<!-- Neck & Head -->
									<path d="M 270 145 C 295 130 310 100 325 85 C 335 75 350 78 360 85 C 345 105 325 140 280 165 Z" fill="#0f766e" />
									<!-- Head details: Eye & Beak with teeth -->
									<circle cx="340" cy="85" r="3.5" fill="#facc15" />
									<polygon points="355,85 385,92 355,96" fill="#f59e0b" />
									<!-- Tiny serrated teeth markers -->
									<line x1="360" y1="92" x2="378" y2="92" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="1.5 2" />
								</g>

								<!-- Dynamic Forelimb Wing (Dynamically scaled via script) -->
								<g id="svg-wing" transform="translate(240, 140)">
									<path id="svg-wing-feathers" d="M 0 0 C -30 -60, -90 -70, -120 -60 C -90 -30, -50 -10, 0 10 Z" fill="#34d399" opacity="0.9" />
									<polyline id="svg-wing-bone" points="0,0 -40,-40 -85,-45" stroke="#ec4899" stroke-width="3.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" />
									<!-- Wing Forelimb Label -->
									<text id="svg-wing-label" x="-80" y="-55" fill="#a7f3d0" font-size="11" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle">
										Forelimb / 前肢
									</text>
								</g>
							</svg>

							<!-- Floating Badge on Canvas -->
							<div id="canvas-verdict-badge" class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900/90 border border-emerald-500/50 text-xs font-mono text-emerald-300 font-bold">
								<span class="lang-zh">分类：地栖快跑型古鸟</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Verdict: Ground Runner Specialist</span>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="mt-3 text-center text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400">
							<span class="lang-zh">粉色线为前肢骨骼；蓝色线为后肢骨骼；红色为可抬起第二脚趾</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Pink = Forelimb skeleton; Blue = Hindlimb bones; Red = Extensible 2nd toe</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Controls & Flight Meter Column (5 cols) -->
					<div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4 font-mono">
						<!-- Flight Score Meter Card -->
						<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
							<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
								<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-300 font-bold">
									<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-ping"></span>
									<span class="lang-zh">理论飞行能力指数 (0–100)</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Flight Score Meter (0–100)</span>
								</div>
								<span id="meter-score-num" class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-400">25</span>
							</div>

							<!-- Visual Score Bar -->
							<div class="w-full bg-slate-950 rounded-full h-3 mt-2 overflow-hidden border border-slate-800">
								<div id="meter-score-bar" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-500 via-amber-400 to-emerald-400 h-full w-[25%] transition-all duration-300"></div>
							</div>

							<div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
								<span class="text-slate-400">
									<span class="lang-zh">运动生态位裁定:</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Ecological Verdict:</span>
								</span>
								<strong id="meter-verdict-text" class="text-amber-300 font-bold text-right">
									<span class="lang-zh">🏃 纯地栖敏捷奔跑 / 偶尔短突扑翼</span>
									<span class="lang-en">🏃 Specialized Runner / Burst Flier</span>
								</strong>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Interactive Presets Selector -->
						<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 space-y-3">
							<div class="text-xs text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">
								<span class="lang-zh">🏛️ 物种对比预设 (Forelimb / Hindlimb)</span>
								<span class="lang-en">🏛️ Species Comparison Presets</span>
							</div>

							<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs">
								<button id="btn-preset-yuezhuo" type="button" class="preset-btn p-2 rounded-lg bg-emerald-950/80 border border-emerald-400 text-emerald-200 font-bold transition active:scale-95 text-left cursor-pointer">
									<div class="flex justify-between items-center">
										<span class="font-bold">杨源鸑鷟鸟</span>
										<span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-300 font-mono">0.70</span>
									</div>
									<div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-normal">
										<span class="lang-zh">晚侏罗世 · 弃飞地栖古鸟</span>
										<span class="lang-en">Yuezhuornis · Runner</span>
									</div>
								</button>

								<button id="btn-preset-archaeo" type="button" class="preset-btn p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700 text-slate-300 transition active:scale-95 text-left cursor-pointer">
									<div class="flex justify-between items-center">
										<span class="font-bold">始祖鸟</span>
										<span class="text-[10px] text-cyan-300 font-mono">1.15</span>
									</div>
									<div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-normal">
										<span class="lang-zh">晚侏罗世 · 滑翔扑翼</span>
										<span class="lang-en">Archaeopteryx · Glider</span>
									</div>
								</button>

